OL,3,GOrkney & Shetland
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FThis morning will be cloudy
OL,6,Fwith rain spreading east for a time.
OL,7,FDrier and brighter weather with a few
OL,8,Fshowers spreading from the west this
OL,9,Fafternoon. Strong south or
OL,10,Fsouthwesterly winds this morning.
OL,11,
OL,12,CTonight:FPartly cloudy with a few
OL,13,Fshowers this evening. Then the rest of
OL,14,Fthe night will see clear periods and
OL,15,Fjust a few light showers. Fresh
OL,16,Fnorthwesterly winds across Shetland.
OL,17,
OL,18,CWednesday:FChance of a light shower at
OL,19,Ffirst otherwise dry with a few bright
OL,20,For sunny spells. Light winds.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
