OL,4,
OL,5,COutlook for Thursday to Saturday:FCloud
OL,6,Fand rain spreading northeast for a
OL,7,Ftime on Thursday. Bright spells and a
OL,8,Ffew showers on Friday and Saturday,
OL,9,Fbreezy at times.
